# SHG Member ID Card Photo Automation - Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Automate the process of updating SHG member photos on the Minmathi ID Card portal. The script will navigate the UI, download photos, resize them to 300x400px, and re-upload them.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Credentials**: User needs to provide credentials (username/password) safely, likely via `.env` file or direct input, as they are not in the plan.
> **Environment**: Requires Chrome installed for Selenium ChromeDriver.

